# The same stage twice off one source. Nothing says these are channels; the
# lane split has to fall out of cutting the source.
net GND
net 5V
net OUTL
net OUTR
part TDA1545A:DAC
part 2k1:Riv_L
part 2k1:Riv_R
part TL074:U1A
part TL074:U1B
DAC@4 -> GND
DAC@5 -> 5V
DAC@8 -> U1A@2
U1A@2 -> Riv_R@1
U1A@1 -> Riv_R@2
U1A@3 -> GND
U1A@1 -> OUTR
DAC@6 -> U1B@6
U1B@6 -> Riv_L@1
U1B@7 -> Riv_L@2
U1B@5 -> GND
U1B@7 -> OUTL
